name=Infection Cancellation
id=infectionCancellation
description=This mod gives you a chance to survive a infection. (Default: 2%, but changeable in Sandbox Options)
description=In addition with the Perk "Fast Healer" you fight the Infection faster. (Only faster, not better)
description=
description=
description=Update to B42 - 09.Feb.2025 
description=If something is buggy just message me.
description=
description=Original Mod by WierdBill, Sandbox Options and Fast Healer by Pandaa
description=Original Text from WierdBill:
description=In Project Zomboid, once you're infected, you're done for.
description=
description=Whenever my friend and I see the "queasy" moodle shortly after taking damage or whenever we're bitten, we just drink a whole bottle of bleach to get done with it fast.
description=That makes for a very anticlimactic end to our save files.
description=
description=This mod aims to counteract that.
description=
description=Basically what this mod does is that, towards the end of your infection cycle, you get a (2%) ^ (infected wounds) chance to survive and for the infection to calm down.
description=No more suicide, no more easy escape. Now you must fight with despair as your health degrades over time, and hope for the best.
description=Maybe you'll live to see another day ? Probably not... But you can at least go out with a bang.
description=
description=/!\ The dice roll may not trigger if sandbox option "Infection Mortality" is set to under 0-12h /!\
description=May be incompatible with other mods that changes infection behavior.
description=This mod doesn't trigger an infection, it can only cancel one. If it breaks it should never get you killed.
description=
description=Feel free to modify and patch the mod as you wish.
description=
description=Thanks to everyone that helped me in the official Project Zomboid Discord.
